### ==============================================================================
### DriveVue AI - Gemini AI Smart Car Recommendation API Tests
### ==============================================================================
### Use this file with the VS Code REST Client extension (humao.rest-client)
### Server URL: http://localhost:5000
### Endpoint: POST http://localhost:5000/api/ai/recommend
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@contentType = application/json

### ==============================================================================
### TEST 1: Family Road Trip Recommendation
### ==============================================================================
### Should recommend SUV or spacious vehicles with 5+ seats
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/recommend
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "prompt": "I need a spacious and comfortable vehicle for a family vacation of 5 with plenty of luggage for a week-long road trip."
}

###

### ==============================================================================
### TEST 2: Eco-Friendly & Electric Car Recommendation
### ==============================================================================
### Should recommend Electric vehicles like Tesla Model 3
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/recommend
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "prompt": "Looking for a futuristic, fast, and eco-friendly electric car with cutting-edge tech for city commuting."
}

###

### ==============================================================================
### TEST 3: Luxury Executive / Business Trip
### ==============================================================================
### Should recommend Luxury cars like Mercedes-Benz S-Class or BMW
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/recommend
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "prompt": "I am hosting international business executives and need a premium, sophisticated luxury sedan that makes a great first impression."
}

###

### ==============================================================================
### TEST 4: High-Performance Sports Car
### ==============================================================================
### Should recommend high-performance sports cars like Porsche 911
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/recommend
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "prompt": "I want an adrenaline-pumping, high-performance sports car with manual transmission for a weekend mountain drive."
}

###

### ==============================================================================
### TEST 5: Budget-Conscious / Daily Commuter
### ==============================================================================
### Should recommend affordable, economical vehicles
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/recommend
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "prompt": "I am on a tight budget and need the most affordable, fuel-efficient car for daily errands."
}

###

### ==============================================================================
### TEST 6: Validation Error Test (Empty prompt) -> Expected: 400 Bad Request
### ==============================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/recommend
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "prompt": ""
}
